{"data":{"title":"And Then","slug":"and-then","path":"/artists/james-tillman/tracks/and-then/","artwork":"images/artists/james-tillman/tracks/and-then.jpg","artist":{"id":"PcaPb3UGGQw","slug":"james-tillman","links":null,"title":"James Tillman","artwork":null},"id":"1EDfl4YDq0o"},"appearanceCount":1,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"UQKUtJsffKA","show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":55953,"platform":"appleMusic","href":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/and-then/848480388?i=848480594&uo=4","artwork":"https://is2-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music4/v4/e7/00/29/e7002972-8f94-678d-0d63-1d7bacacb811/source/100x100bb.jpg","last_checked_at":"2020-01-24T17:10:27.431+00:00","track":"1EDfl4YDq0o"},{"id":55951,"platform":"deezer","href":"https://www.deezer.com/track/123915580","artwork":"https://cdns-images.dzcdn.net/images/cover/01a28a6fa8b72682be0751474d375099/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","last_checked_at":"2020-01-24T17:10:21.474+00:00","track":"1EDfl4YDq0o"},{"id":55952,"platform":"tidal","href":"http://www.tidal.com/track/59927608","artwork":"https://resources.wimpmusic.com/images/903e5f70/b48b/4c70/8b45/a32108e7d676/640x640.jpg","last_checke